  "title": "Sriracha-Lime Kale Chips",
  "description": "This Sriracha-lime kale chips recipe is for baked kale tossed in a mixture of Sriracha and lime juice. It's a tasty, guilt-free way to eat your greens.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T10:20:24-04:00",
